<title>UK: Bayer Hypo doubles step-up bond to 200 mln marks.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo doubles step-up bond to 200 mln marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG said it has doubled to 200 million marks the size of its December 1999 step-up callable bond.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY  **23.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.97***  PAY DATE  S-17.SEP.96</p>
<p> FEES   UNDISCLOSED   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING     MUNICH   DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 23.DEC.96 THEN STEPS UP TO 4.75 PCT.</p>
<p>	    **CALL AT PAR 23.DEC.96</p>
<p>	   ***INCLUDES 100 MLN DEM LAUNCHED 10.SEP AT 99.95.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
